OL,3,GNEWSALibrary staff member injured as
OL,4,Aglass door shatters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city centre library has partially
OL,7,Fclosed after a large glass door
OL,8,Fshattered and injured a staff member.
OL,10,FThe main entrance to the ground floor
OL,11,Fof the Norfolk and Norwich Millennium
OL,12,FLibrary at the Forum in Norwich has
OL,13,Fbeen cordoned off following the
OL,14,Fincident.
OL,16,FIn July the 25-year-old library
OL,17,Freopened following a #1.3m revamp, but
OL,18,FNorfolk County Council said the glass
OL,19,Fdoors were installed in 2001 when the
OL,20,Fsite was originally built.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
