OL,3,GNEWSALibrary staff member injured as
OL,4,Aglass door shatters
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The ground floor of the Millennium
OL,7,FLibrary will remain closed until
OL,8,Ffurther notice and all events scheduled
OL,9,Ffor the ground floor today are
OL,10,Fpostponed," the authority said.
